# GCC on CuBit (userspace/ports/gcc): the compiler proper, cc1
# (docs/self-hosting.md, "GCC and GNAT"). Its argv is open-ended (temporary
# names, -I directories), so it has no typed parameters, and no file scopes
# of its own: it works only in the places its launcher delegates (the
# driver passes on what it was given, decision D2). What it writes to
# descriptors 1 and 2 goes to its unix.stdout and unix.stderr outlets.
(Executable_Manifest
  identity => "org.gnu.gcc.cc1"
  version => "15.3.0"
  requests => [(service "filesystem" "filesystem")]
  outlets => [
    (Outlet "unix.stdout" Element.Text pages => 4)
    (Outlet "unix.stderr" Element.Text pages => 4)]
  descriptors => [(Descriptor 1 "unix.stdout") (Descriptor 2 "unix.stderr")])
